            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Various algorithms are disclosed for verifying the stored weight in a non-volatile memory cell in a neural network following a multilevel programming operation of the non-volatile memory cell by converting the stored weight into a plurality of digital output bits. Circuity, such as an adjustable reference current source, for implementing the algorithms are disclosed.</p>
            </abstract>
